thought.text:
**Ini jawaban lengkapnya.** Token CaptchaFox dikirim lewat **header**, bukan body:

```javascript
captchaHeaders(t, r) {
  return this.recaptcha        ? {"g-recaptcha-response": t}
       : this.captchaFox       ? {"cf-captcha-response": t}
       : {...X-CAPTCHA-SOLUTION / X-CAPTCHA-TOKEN}
}
```

Sekarang saya cari endpoint `email-registration` lengkap dengan format body-nya.

action.command:
cd /workspace/project && python3 - <<'PY'
import re
s=open('/tmp/main.js',errors='ignore').read()
for kw in ['accountRestUrl=','accountRestUrl:','suggestionRestUrl=','oneAndOneCaptchaUrl=']:
    for m in list(re.finditer(re.escape(kw),s))[:2]:
        print(f"[{kw}] {re.sub(r'\\s+',' ',s[max(0,m.start()-200):m.start()+220])}\n")
print("=== struktur mailAccount ===")
for m in list(re.finditer(r'mailAccount',s))[:5]:
    print(re.sub(r'\s+',' ',s[max(0,m.start()-250):m.start()+250]),"\n")
PY

